  step("Run one continuous bead", "<p>Cut the nozzle at a 45° angle to make a small opening. Holding the gun at a steady angle, push the bead along the joint in one smooth pass per side, squeezing evenly. Pushing, rather than pulling, drives silicone into the gap.</p><p><strong>Done right:</strong> the gap is filled with no voids or bubbles, and the bead stays between the tape lines.</p>"),
